WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.967 --> 00:00:01.967
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers

00:00:01.967 --> 00:00:02.969
and this is "Late Night."

00:00:02.969 --> 00:00:04.303
We hope you're doing well
and, now,

00:00:04.303 --> 00:00:05.771
if you don't mind, we are going
to get to the news.

00:00:05.771 --> 00:00:08.774
President Biden signed the
bipartisan infrastructure bill

00:00:08.774 --> 00:00:12.211
into law yesterday and said,
"America is moving again.

00:00:12.211 --> 00:00:14.614
And, this time, not to Canada."

00:00:14.614 --> 00:00:15.982
[ Laughter ]

00:00:15.982 --> 00:00:18.051
During the signing
ceremony yesterday

00:00:18.051 --> 00:00:19.786
for the bipartisan
infrastructure bill,

00:00:19.786 --> 00:00:21.821
President Biden twice referred

00:00:21.821 --> 00:00:24.089
to Arizona
Senator Kyrsten Sinema

00:00:24.089 --> 00:00:27.326
as Krysten, and that's the worst
thing you can call her,

00:00:27.326 --> 00:00:28.561
besides a Democrat.

00:00:28.561 --> 00:00:31.030
She hates that.
[ Ohs and laughter ]

00:00:31.030 --> 00:00:32.465
According to a new book,

00:00:32.465 --> 00:00:35.167
former acting Defense Secretary
Christopher Miller

00:00:35.167 --> 00:00:37.236
purposely offered
then-President Trump

00:00:37.236 --> 00:00:39.005
extreme military scenarios

00:00:39.005 --> 00:00:40.740
in the final weeks
of his presidency,

00:00:40.740 --> 00:00:43.409
to prevent him
from choosing to attack Iran.

00:00:43.409 --> 00:00:46.279
Unfortunately, he opted
for the craziest one --

00:00:46.279 --> 00:00:48.013
attacking the U.S.

00:00:48.013 --> 00:00:50.850
[ Laughter and oohs ]

00:00:50.850 --> 00:00:53.219
I guess that's about as well
as that one could've gone.

00:00:53.219 --> 00:00:54.487
[ Laughter ]

00:00:54.487 --> 00:00:55.821
"You guys remember
that awful day.

00:00:55.821 --> 00:00:56.823
Ha ha ha ha ha.

00:00:56.823 --> 00:00:58.324
[ Laughter ]

00:00:58.324 --> 00:01:01.260
Ha ha ha ha ha."

00:01:01.260 --> 00:01:03.362
Former Trump advisor
Steve Bannon surrendered

00:01:03.362 --> 00:01:05.865
to federal authorities yesterday
to face charges

00:01:05.865 --> 00:01:08.501
of contempt of Congress and,
looking at him,

00:01:08.501 --> 00:01:10.036
I have to assume Congress is

00:01:10.036 --> 00:01:11.437
a brand of soap?

00:01:11.437 --> 00:01:13.539
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:13.539 --> 00:01:15.975
The Biden administration
has announced it's planning

00:01:15.975 --> 00:01:18.578
to hold the annual White House
Christmas party this year,

00:01:18.578 --> 00:01:20.212
but, for the first time
in four years,

00:01:20.212 --> 00:01:21.513
without Frosty.

00:01:21.513 --> 00:01:25.050
[ Laughter and oohs ]

00:01:25.050 --> 00:01:27.219
After being treated
for the coronavirus

00:01:27.219 --> 00:01:29.288
at Walter Reed Medical Center
last year,

00:01:29.288 --> 00:01:31.825
former President Trump
reportedly considered

00:01:31.825 --> 00:01:33.259
ripping off his dress shirt

00:01:33.259 --> 00:01:34.594
when he returned
to the White House,

00:01:34.594 --> 00:01:37.096
to reveal a Superman shirt
underneath.

00:01:37.096 --> 00:01:38.230
But then, he remembered

00:01:38.230 --> 00:01:40.299
Superman was
an "undocamented inmigrant."

00:01:40.299 --> 00:01:42.034
[ Laughter and oohs ]

00:01:42.034 --> 00:01:44.404
Definitely said
both those words wrong.

00:01:44.404 --> 00:01:45.805
[ Laughter ]

00:01:45.805 --> 00:01:47.674
It is "undocamented," right?

00:01:47.674 --> 00:01:50.343
[ Laughter ]

00:01:50.343 --> 00:01:52.378
What happened was the wheels
came off on undocumented

00:01:52.378 --> 00:01:53.846
and then, I was lost
on immigrant.

00:01:53.846 --> 00:01:55.114
[ Laughter ]

00:01:55.114 --> 00:01:56.882
I think I used one of the M's
in immigrant

00:01:56.882 --> 00:02:00.619
in undocumented,
so, there's only one left there.

00:02:00.619 --> 00:02:04.557
[ Laughter ]
Guardrails came off, bud.

00:02:04.557 --> 00:02:05.958
You know what?
Just, in post,

00:02:05.958 --> 00:02:07.226
move the "M."

00:02:07.226 --> 00:02:09.562
[ Laughter ]
Audio, if you're listening,

00:02:09.562 --> 00:02:13.533
just take the "M"
from "undocumamented"...

00:02:13.533 --> 00:02:15.234
[ Laughter ]

00:02:15.234 --> 00:02:18.671
...slide it into immigrant
and I think it'll be seamless.

00:02:18.671 --> 00:02:20.306
[ Laughter ]

00:02:20.306 --> 00:02:21.507
They'll match it to my lips,

00:02:21.507 --> 00:02:23.542
so, I'll just say it right now
without words

00:02:23.542 --> 00:02:25.645
and then,
you can use these lips.

00:02:26.746 --> 00:02:28.081
[ Laughter ]

00:02:28.081 --> 00:02:29.815
Just watch the show tonight
and see, yeah.

00:02:29.815 --> 00:02:32.251
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:02:32.251 --> 00:02:35.154
Let's see how they
cut it together.

00:02:35.154 --> 00:02:37.923
A woman reportedly climbed
over the barrier

00:02:37.923 --> 00:02:40.293
to Bronx Zoo's lion exhibit
last week

00:02:40.293 --> 00:02:42.128
while carrying a bouquet
of roses,

00:02:42.128 --> 00:02:43.296
or, as the lion saw it,

00:02:43.296 --> 00:02:44.963
dinner, holding some garnish.

00:02:44.963 --> 00:02:47.133
[ Laughter and awws ]

00:02:47.133 --> 00:02:50.904
More than 450 people in Egypt
were stung over the weekend

00:02:50.904 --> 00:02:54.673
after flooding drove thousands
of scorpions into villages.

00:02:54.673 --> 00:02:57.076
And that's why you don't tap
on the glass

00:02:57.076 --> 00:02:58.377
of King Tut's mummy!

00:02:58.377 --> 00:03:00.913
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:03:00.913 --> 00:03:02.048
And, finally --

00:03:02.048 --> 00:03:03.816
[ Laughter ]

00:03:03.816 --> 00:03:05.318
Is it a good sign or a bad sign

00:03:05.318 --> 00:03:07.220
when I can only hear
Wally laughing?

00:03:07.220 --> 00:03:11.090
[ Laughter ]

00:03:11.090 --> 00:03:12.791
And fi--

00:03:12.791 --> 00:03:14.560
I think you're laughing
because nobody else was, Wally,

00:03:14.560 --> 00:03:15.662
and I don't like that.

00:03:15.662 --> 00:03:18.430
[ Laughter ]

00:03:18.430 --> 00:03:19.565
Oh, keep it up, Wally.

00:03:19.565 --> 00:03:20.799
[ Laughter ]

00:03:20.799 --> 00:03:22.902
And, finally,
the restaurant chain Applebee's

00:03:22.902 --> 00:03:25.571
began offering so-called
Cosmic Wings yesterday,

00:03:25.571 --> 00:03:27.373
which features chicken tossed

00:03:27.373 --> 00:03:30.009
in Original or Flamin' Hot
Cheetos cheese sauce,

00:03:30.009 --> 00:03:31.910
and that's not all
they're tossed in.

00:03:31.910 --> 00:03:33.646
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:03:33.646 --> 00:03:34.747
That was a monologue, everybody.

